Package: bbsrgeo
Title: Access and Convert BBSR Area Crosswalks for German Regional
    Statistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Stefan", "Moog", email = "stefan.moog@prognos.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to download and read the area crosswalks
    ('Umstiegsschluessel') for municipalities and districts published by
    the BBSR (Bundesinstitut fuer Bau-, Stadt- und Raumforschung, Germany's
    Federal Institute for Research on Building, Urban Affairs and Spatial
    Development), and to convert German regional statistics time series
    from the Regionaldatenbank Deutschland (GENESIS-Regio) onto a
    consistent set of area boundaries.
